    "created_at": "2022-01-12T12:36:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-01-12T12:36:43Z",
    "body": "i don't think we should restrict what a fieldset can contain, because you want to be able to put styling-related elements between your input fields. however i wonder if fieldset outside of a form makes any sense.",
